  "claim_boundary": "Source-calibrated, source-test-only virtual sensing replay on existing public DEFORM training trajectories. A fixed global portfolio of genuinely competing source-response prototype actions and one shared sensor likelihood scale and prototype shrinkage are selected without official evaluation files. The normalized-regret tolerance is a fixed 0.05 task requirement and is not optimized for RMSE. Internal-node readouts are masked and revealed from already recorded prefixes, and future internal-node outcomes are sliced only after all source-test measurement paths and actions are frozen. Exact regret is conditional on the registered finite local support and quotient; source-test target violations remain empirical. The result is exploratory because an earlier simpler source pilot and the first v2 run motivated this corrected protocol. It is not unseen-object generalization, learned-vision validation, continuous-control certification, deployment safety, or state of the art."
